{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:bb9cced995bd5b42","name":"Spy Bug","source":{"id":"source:reference-bb9cced995bd5b42","title":"Spy Bug","revision":20317,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:37:30Z","sha256":"1cc9a85ffb80bf49959f8a3cefe8687db2c496b6d0e8f6e8ba2b0a9f261d1c36","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20317","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Spy%20Bug&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-bb9cced995bd5b42","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 1,300\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 0.5 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["This Diminutive, bioengineered insect records sights and sounds within 20 squares of it. It can be placed in a hidden area and remains there until retrieved. When the Spy Bug is retrieved, the data that it has absorbed through its senses for the past 24 hours can be extracted. (The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Yuuzhan Vong"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Yuuzhan_Vong","referenceId":"reference:93079e2f7d73d480"}," use living devices to retrieve the data, but a DC 25 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"}," check can transmit the data via electronic connectors or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Comlink"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Comlink","referenceId":"reference:609e72c37493843f"},"). A Spy Bug functions as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Holorecorder Unit"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Holorecorder_Unit"},". A Spy Bug registers as a life form on sensors, not as an electronic device.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
